w"><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; </span><span class="p">}</span><span class="w"><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; </span><span class="p">],</span><span class="w"><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; </span><span class="nl">"dataURL"</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">[</span><span class="w"><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; </span><span class="s2">"image/Airport/airport_01.jpg"</span><span class="w"><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; </span><span class="p">],</span><span class="w"><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; </span><span class="nl">"labels"</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">[</span><span class="w"><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w"><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; </span><span class="nl">"type"</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s2">"AI_SceneLabel"</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; </span><span class="nl">"class"</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s2">"Airport"</span><span class="w"><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; </span><span class="p">}</span><span class="w"><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; </span><span class="p">]</span><span class="w"><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; </span><span class="p">},</span><span class="w"><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; </span><span class="err">&#x2026;</span><span class="w"><br/>&#xA0; </span><span class="p">]</span><span class="w"><br/></span><span class="p">}</span></p>

