<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_8c1b57d3-3076-89e7-c05f-26e40b1e3c72" id="_8c1b57d3-3076-89e7-c05f-26e40b1e3c72"></a>The AI_Task object is encoded as a JSON object with properties as shown in <a href="#table-ai-task-properties">Table 7</a>.</p>

