<p class="Sourcecode"><a name="_72b76876-9aec-102f-a51f-200fac39364c" id="_72b76876-9aec-102f-a51f-200fac39364c"></a><span class="p">{</span><span class="w"><br/>&#xA0; </span><span class="nl">"type"</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s2">"AI_LabelingProcedure"</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"><br/>&#xA0; </span><span class="nl">"id"</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s2">"0"</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"><br/>&#xA0; </span><span class="nl">"methods"</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">[</span><span class="w"><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; </span><span class="s2">"manual"</span><span class="w"><br/>&#xA0; </span><span class="p">],</span><span class="w"><br/>&#xA0; </span><span class="nl">"tools"</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">[</span><span class="w"><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; </span><span class="s2">"ArcGIS"</span><span class="w"><br/>&#xA0; </span><span class="p">]</span><span class="w"><br/></span><span class="p">}</span></p>


<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_c851edc8-cbdb-cd08-41d5-da6b88548cdf" id="_c851edc8-cbdb-cd08-41d5-da6b88548cdf"></a>The AI_LabelingMethodCode is encoded as a text string whose value is one of &#x201C;manual&#x201D;, &#x201C;semi-automatic&#x201D;, &#x201C;automatic&#x201D; or &#x201C;unknown&#x201D;.</p>

<div align="center" class="table_container"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;" width="100%"><a name="_8e9e9714-487c-9437-eb7a-1cfd6d91eff8" id="_8e9e9714-487c-9437-eb7a-1cfd6d91eff8"></a><colgroup><col width="20%"/><col width="80%"/></colgroup><tbody><tr><td valign="middle" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;" width="20.0%">Requirement 30</td><td valign="middle" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;" width="80.0%"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_6d381562-99d9-d9dd-c768-1964b3ebca57" id="_6d381562-99d9-d9dd-c768-1964b3ebca57"></a>/req/ailabeling/labelingmethodcode</p>

<p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_38c9552c-3493-7a75-ae81-d0ff69ccedaf" id="_38c9552c-3493-7a75-ae81-d0ff69ccedaf"></a>Each AI_LabelingMethodCode value SHALL be a text string whose value is one of &#x201C;manual&#x201D;, &#x201C;semi-automatic&#x201D;, &#x201C;automatic&#x201D; or &#x201C;unknown&#x201D;.</p>
</td></tr></tbody></table></div>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_8448942d-ab2f-9760-c49d-8871a4b88573" id="_8448942d-ab2f-9760-c49d-8871a4b88573"></a>Examples:</p>

<p class="Sourcecode"><a name="_f08f6af1-e76d-eca7-c55e-63031abe5061" id="_f08f6af1-e76d-eca7-c55e-63031abe5061"></a> a)	"manual"<br/>&#xA0;b)	"semi-automatic"<br/>&#xA0;c)	"automatic"<br/>&#xA0;d)	"unknown"</p>

</div>
