      <div class="Section3">
        <a name="annex-ats" id="annex-ats"></a>
        <h1 class="Annex"><b>Annex A</b><br/>(normative)<br/><b>Abstract Test Suite</b></h1>
        <div><a name="_e797a8e1-e603-ec63-b288-19b93ad56149" id="_e797a8e1-e603-ec63-b288-19b93ad56149"></a><h2>A.1.<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Introduction</h2>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_e63820e6-6425-3a25-a1af-b404dd18ff10" id="_e63820e6-6425-3a25-a1af-b404dd18ff10"></a>Conformance is tested using the JSON Schema document which formalize the requirements described above.</p>
</div>
        <div><a name="_6798309f-b7a8-6bd2-4097-95bb591a7bfd" id="_6798309f-b7a8-6bd2-4097-95bb591a7bfd"></a><h2>A.2.<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Conformance Class: Base</h2>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_3b766c57-aabe-e2b1-0aa0-f2c3edb19ff5" id="_3b766c57-aabe-e2b1-0aa0-f2c3edb19ff5"></a>The Base conformance class tests that occurrences of the basic types are encoded according to the requirements.</p>

