0fba85-b0db-dcc6-f23f-6723ac7fdc4c" id="_c60fba85-b0db-dcc6-f23f-6723ac7fdc4c"></a>Verify that JSON instance documents claiming conformance to this specification contain valid URL values according to Uniform Resource Identifier (URI): Generic Syntax [<a href="https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc3986#section-4.1">RFC 3986 Section 4.1</a>]. A URL value can be absolute or relative and may have an optional fragment identifier.</p>
